- Of course there's a plan.

18:30.682 --> 18:34.015
I mean,
I'm a vibrant woman now, Alan...

18:34.186 --> 18:37.622
...but there will come a time when
I won't be able to fend for myself...

18:37.823 --> 18:42.055
...and I don't wanna pay some stranger
to dress me and feed me...

18:42.227 --> 18:45.560
...and carry me to the bath,
soap up a washcloth...

18:45.731 --> 18:48.894
...and give me a good
thorough cleaning.

18:49.635 --> 18:52.331
Thanks, Mom, I'll call you.

18:54.373 --> 18:56.967
That should keep him away
for a while.

19:05.417 --> 19:08.284
- Are you sure you're gonna be okay?
- Yeah, I'm fine.

19:10.455 --> 19:13.424
- Would you do me a little favor?
- What?

19:13.959 --> 19:15.950
Go like this:

19:17.930 --> 19:19.329
For old times' sake.

19:20.465 --> 19:21.489
Chelsea?

19:21.700 --> 19:23.725
- We're ready for you.
- Oh, God, this is it.

19:25.170 --> 19:26.569
Take a deep breath, Charlie.

19:27.306 --> 19:29.171
I will if you will.

19:29.374 --> 19:31.934
It's still gonna be me,
just a little smaller.

19:32.144 --> 19:33.406
I know.

19:33.578 --> 19:36.877
I guess the good news is it'll draw
more attention to your backside.

19:37.382 --> 19:39.043
What?

19:40.185 --> 19:44.212
You know, with your breasts smaller, the
eye will naturally go to your ample tush.

19:44.456 --> 19:48.859
- Are you saying my ass is too big?
- No, no, no. I love your ass.

19:49.027 --> 19:51.894
I'm saying with smaller boobs,
more people will notice it.

19:52.097 --> 19:54.657
Are you insane?
I don't want people noticing my ass.

19:54.866 --> 19:56.766
Hey, hey, hey.
Don't kill the messenger.

19:56.969 --> 19:58.596
It's the first law of landscaping.

19:58.770 --> 20:01.898
If you trim down the tree,
the backyard looks bigger. Am I right?

20:02.774 --> 20:04.173
Damn you, Charlie Harper.

20:04.376 --> 20:06.537
- What?
- Tell the doctor I changed my mind.

20:07.179 --> 20:09.238
- What did I say? Where are you going?
- Home.

20:09.481 --> 20:11.449
- What about your back pain?
- I'll live with it.

20:11.616 --> 20:13.777
- Are you sure?
- I live with you, don't I?

20:14.286 --> 20:15.412
Come on.

20:16.254 --> 20:17.915
Well, how about that?

20:20.258 --> 20:23.421
Thank you, Lord.
You speaketh through me.
